{
	"name": "Radiant Standard",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-pink.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Raising the standard high you invoke a word of power, causing it to flare with magical fire that limns it and lights your way. As an action, you activate the flag’s light which shines brightly for 40ft and dimly for another 40ft. In addition, perception checks relying on sight within 40ft of the banner gain expertise. The radiance also suppresses any invisibility or other illusions within the bright light. You can use this light for up to 1 hour per day, in 10 minute increments.</p>",
